OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aafter second glitch this month causes
OL,5,Amore disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across the UK have been
OL,8,Fdisrupted by a "technical issue" with
OL,9,Fair traffic control - these are the
OL,10,Fairports affected
OL,12,FNats, which runs air traffic control,
OL,13,Fsays it had "nothing to do" with a
OL,14,Fsoftware defect that led to the
OL,15,Fcancellation of 2,000 flights earlier
OL,16,Fthis month
OL,18,FThe issue at Nats' Prestwick centre in
OL,19,FAyrshire is "now fixed", with the
OL,20,Fsystem running "at full capacity"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
