OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aafter second glitch this month causes
OL,5,Amore disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FAround 200 flights were cancelled or
OL,8,Fdid not fly today, says analytics firm
OL,9,FCirium
OL,11,FEasyJet says this "once again calls
OL,12,Finto questions the resilience of Nats'
OL,13,Fsystems" - while trade body Airlines UK
OL,14,Fsays both passengers and airlines
OL,15,F"deserve better"
